        "original_id": "e6834c40-d22e-508e-9b4e-d3711cea8609",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Events: 2009 Minneapolis mayoral election\n- People: R. T. Rybak\n- Roles: Mayor of Minneapolis\n\nFacts:\n- R. T. Rybak took office as Mayor of Minneapolis in January 2002.\n- R. T. Rybak won a second term as Mayor of Minneapolis in November 2005.\n- The 2009 Minneapolis mayoral election was held on November 3, 2009, to elect the Mayor of Minneapolis for a four-year term.\n- R. T. Rybak won a third term in November 2009.\n- R. T. Rybak won re-election in the first round of the 2009 Minneapolis mayoral election with 73.6% of the vote.",
